<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-17T23:02:30.401Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:02:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a drone attack on the U.S. radar system at Sheikh Isa air base in Bahrain and targeted American interests on Qeshm Island, prompting U.S. self-defence strikes on Iranian missile launch sites on the island and on vessels in the Gulf of Oman. Iran also claimed a drone strike on a U.S. base in Bahrain and reported that its mines hit five ships in the Hormuz Strait, while the United States responded with additional airstrikes on Iranian missile sites. A whistleblower said a deadly drone strike in Kuwait could have been avoided. 123 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261117-trump-says-he-takes-possible-iran-bomb-threat-to-washington-very-seriously&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/e79991c9-3f45-461a-9e3a-9c9f15ec029a?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/world/middleeast/iran-dams-missile-sites-environmentalists.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/17/iran-claims-drone-attack-on-us-radar-system-at-sheikh-isa-air-base-in-bahrain&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/16/us-and-iran-slide-closer-to-fresh-all-out-war-as-new-exchange-of-fire-increases&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1Vb0RmWXNaMXVnWXAxb0ZrSUlJWU8wOU9TMXJ4NFljc3FiVzBhWm1CcHRMMWRvN1haNkk3OXU3TWsycUtyQnA4MEVqSkpYNk1JWVJ2U2w0LWg1cjVaLXFuV0NnQm9GenJyUDRONGF3c3VYMG9qM0dz?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/17/us-strikes-targets-in-qeshm-island-after-iranian-mines-hit-five-ships-in-